OL,3,GNEWSAPods proposed to tackle rough
OL,4,Asleeping
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo emergency accommodation pods for
OL,7,Fpeople sleeping rough are set to be
OL,8,Finstalled in Spalding.
OL,10,FSouth Holland District Council said the
OL,11,Fpods would provide short-term shelter
OL,12,Fand their rough sleeper team would
OL,13,Fprovide support to develop longer-term
OL,14,Fsolutions.
OL,16,FThe proposal forms part of the
OL,17,Fauthority's efforts to tackle
OL,18,Fhomelessness while supporting the
OL,19,Fgovernment's ambition to end rough
OL,20,Fsleeping.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
