OL,3,GNEWSAPods proposed to tackle rough
OL,4,Asleeping
OL,5,
OL,6,FTracey Carter, portfolio holder for
OL,7,Fstrategic and operational housing, said
OL,8,Fthe pods would offer "a safe and secure
OL,9,Fenvironment where individuals can
OL,10,Fengage with support services".
